### Health
GET http://localhost:8080/api/health
Accept: application/json

### Crear persona válida -> 201
POST http://localhost:8080/api/personas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Maria",
  "apellido": "Lopez",
  "documento": "7845123",
  "telefono": "+591 70000001",
  "correoElectronico": "maria.lopez@condoflow.com"
}

### Crear persona con nombre vacío -> 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/personas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "",
  "apellido": "Lopez",
  "documento": "7845123",
  "telefono": "+591 70000001",
  "correoElectronico": "otra@condoflow.com"
}

### Crear persona con correo inválido -> 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/personas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Maria",
  "apellido": "Lopez",
  "documento": "7845123",
  "telefono": "+591 70000001",
  "correoElectronico": "no-es-un-correo"
}

### Listar personas -> 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/personas

### Listar con filtro -> 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/personas?buscar=lopez

### Buscar por id existente -> 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/personas/1

### Buscar por id inexistente -> 404
GET http://localhost:8080/api/personas/999
